\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Complete PulseFormer generation pipeline. Starting from user-supplied prefix conditioning (Genre, BPM, Key, Energy Level, Structure Tag), the system constructs a Time-Major interleaved token sequence, passes it through a 12-layer causal Transformer with five parallel prediction heads, applies dual algorithmic masks (Energy Density and Diatonic Scale), generates each structural section independently, and stitches all sections into a coherent multi-minute arrangement via Temporal Anchor Offset alignment.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{3}{Complete PulseFormer generation pipeline. Starting from user-supplied prefix conditioning (Genre, BPM, Key, Energy Level, Structure Tag), the system constructs a Time-Major interleaved token sequence, passes it through a 12-layer causal Transformer with five parallel prediction heads, applies dual algorithmic masks (Energy Density and Diatonic Scale), generates each structural section independently, and stitches all sections into a coherent multi-minute arrangement via Temporal Anchor Offset alignment}{figure.1}{}}
